# Sample MCP Initialize Request

File: ooda/mcp/examples/initialize_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {"name": "openooda-mcp-client", "version": "0.1.0"}
  }
}
```

## Expected Response (abbreviated)

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "result": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {"subscribe": false}},
    "serverInfo": {"name": "openooda-mcp", "version": "0.5.0"}
  }
}
```
